    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d407">

                <pb facs="0559" n="517" sameAs="frus:frus1863p1/pg517"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Lord Lyons.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1863-03-03"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >March</hi> 3, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Lord</hi>: Referring to your memorandum of the
                    19th ultimo, relative to colored emigrants from the United States for service in
                    the British West Indian colonies, and to my reply, I now have the honor to
                    enclose to you the copy of a letter of yesterday, from the Secretary of the
                    Interior, on the subject, together with a copy of the despatch to Mr. Adams,
                    therein referred to.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with high consideration, your lordship’s obedient
                    servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Right Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lord Lyons</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d407-a1.xml" xpointer="d407-a1"/>
